                                                "sense_id": "f17f8184-6a5b-3766-b6a7-03e05dc11479",
                                                "text": "We auditioned several actors for the part."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7a14c58-1dfa-4414-9051-fd4107f49398",
                                                "sense_id": "f17f8184-6a5b-3766-b6a7-03e05dc11479",
                                                "text": "I was only once faced with the task of auditioning a nimiety of sopranos."
